{"title": "[外絮] 勇士老闆:我們之前選秀跟球員培養沒做好", "author": "pneumo (超☆冒險蓋)", "board": "", "date": "Wed Nov  4 12:39:05 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793767149.A.3E8.html", "body": "來源：NBC Sports\n網址：\nhttps://tinyurl.com/mrt9adj7\n\nYaxel Lendeborg has exceeded just about everyone's expectations. Including\nhis own.\n\nYaxel目前的表現超乎了所有人的預期，甚至包括他自己。\n\nDoes that change the Warriors' outlook on the 2026-27 NBA season? Golden\nState owner Joe Lacob certainly believes so.\n\n這是否改變了勇士原先對今年賽季的展望呢？勇士老闆Lacob認為的確是如此：\n\n\"I do,\" Lacob told 95.7 The Game's \"Steiny & Guru\" on Monday when asked if\nLendeborg's immediate breakout has changed the team's outlook on the season.\n\"Look, we've made our mistakes. Everyone makes mistakes, and we didn't get\nthe draft exactly right, or maybe we didn't get the development right on a\ncouple other higher draft choices in the past. Fine, criticize us for that,\nbut the draft is hard guys.\n\n「真的，我認為那改變了。」\n\n「聽著，我們犯過錯，大家都會犯錯；我們之前選秀的時候沒做好，也許我們之前對於\n\n一些高順位選秀的球員培養沒做好。」\n\n「好，可以因此批評我們，但是，選秀真的難。」\n\n\"It is hard, and not everybody gets it. Some teams never get it right, and we\ngot this one right. I was 100 percent sold that this was the guy we wanted in\nthe draft, we were, not just me, and there were some other really good\nplayers in this draft. The only question was 'Would he get to No. 11?' And I\nwas confident, actually that he would, because the NBA, I've been doing this\na long time now, the NBA GMs just love their 18- and 19-year-olds. We've all\nbeen guilty of looking at 'There's great upside to some of these guys,' but\nthis guy seemed like a champion, ready to play.\"\n\n「選秀真的難，不是每個人都會。有些球隊從來沒選對過，但是這次我們選對了！」\n\n「我那時候一百趴認為這就是我們要選的人，我們一群人都是這樣認為。」\n\n「這次還有一些其他不錯的球員，但是那時候的唯一的問題是：\n\n『他會掉到第11順位嗎？』\n\n「我當時其實很有信心，而實際上也是如此，因為我在NBA很久了，我知道總管們都喜歡\n\n18或19歲的年輕小夥子。」\n\n「我們過去都曾有過\"這些球員有巨大潛力\"的想法，但是這個傢伙看起來就像個冠軍球\n\n員，已經是可以上場比賽的了。」\n\n\"The amazing thing is, everything we thought he could be, he's come in and\nkind of exceeded that,\" Lacob added. \"I think Steve has stated that. He's\nsurprised Steve for sure. He doesn't have any weaknesses is what I would say.\"\n\n「神奇的是，每件我們預期他可以做到的事情，他做到了，甚至做的更多。」\n\n「我認為教練Kerr已經講過了，他也確實讓Kerr感到驚訝。」\n\n「我甚至會說，他沒有任何弱點。」\n\n----\n\n老闆很愛", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "LukaDoncic77", "content": "勇士養出來了", "time": "11/04 12:39"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "waterQAQ", "content": "感覺現在說有點早 先看個半季比較好判斷", "time": "11/04 12:40"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hasroten", "content": "\"我們\"", "time": "11/04 12:40"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "qq0526", "content": "是不是在臭", "time": "11/04 12:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ignativs", "content": "看勇士的案例 眼光比養成重要", "time": "11/04 12:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "UD305", "content": "所以選秀當時在吵什麼？！", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "tsai529", "content": "這位老闆選秀日不是要選ament嗎 還跟總管吵起來 怎", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "tsai529", "content": "麼現在變成說想選牙宿了？", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "f77928", "content": "馬刺：就142選秀很難嗎？", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "justice0926", "content": "選秀才是問題吧 就你在那搞事", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "flymyfinger", "content": "所以是在說誰", "time": "11/04 12:42"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "tailsean", "content": "之前就你在搞", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "flymyfinger", "content": "說出來.jpg", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Fezico", "content": "這隻老闆要的吧？總管不是想換掉？", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Landius", "content": "眼光真的很重要,你的體系要燒腦,真的要腦子列入評估", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "harrybbs", "content": "大學教練小牛的May也看走眼欸", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "gabriel", "content": "之前選這隻你不是很氣??", "time": "11/04 12:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ooxxman", "content": "被苦命和智將教訓過了，勇士體系還是給成熟大齡較好", "time": "11/04 12:44"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "super009", "content": "普洱苦命製醬表示：", "time": "11/04 12:45"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "love1500274", "content": "\"有些球隊從來沒選對過\" 自行想像", "time": "11/04 12:46"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "rey0616", "content